        <item>
         <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="about_a7_layout">
          <property name="spacing">
           <number>6</number>
          </property>
          <item>
           <widget class="QLabel" name="label_6">
            <property name="font">
             <font>
              <bold>true</bold>
             </font>
            </property>
            <property name="text">
             <string>About the A7 detector</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <widget class="QLabel" name="textEdit">
            <property name="text">
             <string>Over sliding windows (0.3 s long with a 0.1 s step), A7 computes the absolute power (mean square) in the sigma band, the relative sigma power based on the power spectral density (PSD), and the covariance and the correlation between the sigma-filtered and the unfiltered EEG signals [1]. It detects a spindle when the 4 features exceed their thresholds (1.25 µV², 1.6 × STD, 1.3 × STD and 69%), set for the default sigma band (11–16 Hz).</string>
            </property>
            <property name="wordWrap">
             <bool>true</bool>
            </property>
            <property name="variant" stdset="0">
             <string notr="true">help</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <widget class="QLabel" name="textEdit_2">
            <property name="text">
             <string>• &lt;b&gt;Absolute sigma power:&lt;/b&gt; log10(mean squared sigma power).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Relative sigma power:&lt;/b&gt; z-score(log10(PSD sigma band / PSD 4.5–30 Hz)).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Sigma covariance:&lt;/b&gt; z-score(log10(cov(EEG 0.3–30 Hz, EEG sigma band))).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Sigma correlation:&lt;/b&gt; cov(EEG 0.3–30 Hz, EEG sigma band) / (std(EEG 0.3–30 Hz) × std(EEG sigma band)).</string>
            </property>
            <property name="textFormat">
             <enum>Qt::TextFormat::RichText</enum>
            </property>
            <property name="wordWrap">
             <bool>true</bool>
            </property>
            <property name="variant" stdset="0">
             <string notr="true">help</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
